750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) inside reach-in cooler at hotdog counter - ledge beneath condenser (debris);
B) bottom inside microwave at hotdog counter (splash/buildup);
C) shelf underneath microwave at hotdog counter (dust/debris);
D) counter under hotdog rollers (dust/debris);
E) under bun storage drawers at hotdog counter (dust/debris);
F) Haagen Daz freezer - ledge around door seal (debris accumulation);
G) paper boat & napkin dispenser holders at hotdog counter (dust/debris);
H) shelves in kitchen walkin cooler (mold/buildup);   and
I) catch trays of pizza oven (carbon/food debris).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
